@yyyzl/dsh-image-feedback README · 安装：安装前在 [v0.2.0 Release](<https://github.com/yyyzl/dsh-image-feedback/releases/tag/v0.2.0>) 核对预构建包和 [SHA256SUMS.txt](<https://github.com/yyyzl/dsh-image-feedback/releases/download/v0.2.0/SHA256SUMS.txt>)，使用下方固定版本地址。

请当前 Harness 会话中的 Agent 使用正式 `plugin_manager` 工具。先查询：

```json
{"action":"list_bundles"}
```

确认没有冲突的旧版处于启用状态后，再安装：

```json
{"action":"install_bundle","target":"https://github.com/yyyzl/dsh-image-feedback/releases/download/v0.2.0/yyyzl-dsh-image-feedback-0.2.0.tgz"}
```

@yyyzl/dsh-image-feedback README · 安装：安装影响当前 profile 的所有会话。遵循管理工具返回的版本限制、警告和后续操作；需要刷新或重启时按提示执行。不要手动编辑 profile、替换宿主文件或绕过版本限制。

停用前再次核对 bundle 名称，然后使用：

```json
{"action":"set_bundle","target":"@yyyzl/dsh-image-feedback","enabled":false}
```

重新启用将 `enabled` 改为 `true`；卸载使用 `remove_bundle`。停用本身不会清除已有素材、草稿或浏览器恢复数据。

@yyyzl/dsh-image-feedback README · Install：Before installing, check the prebuilt archive and [SHA256SUMS.txt](<https://github.com/yyyzl/dsh-image-feedback/releases/download/v0.2.0/SHA256SUMS.txt>) on the [v0.2.0 release](<https://github.com/yyyzl/dsh-image-feedback/releases/tag/v0.2.0>). Use the fixed-version URL below.

Ask the Agent in your Harness session to use the official `plugin_manager` tool. List bundles first:

```json
{"action":"list_bundles"}
```

After confirming that the legacy bundle is not active, install:

@yyyzl/dsh-image-feedback README · Install：```json
{"action":"install_bundle","target":"https://github.com/yyyzl/dsh-image-feedback/releases/download/v0.2.0/yyyzl-dsh-image-feedback-0.2.0.tgz"}
```

Installation affects every session in the current profile. Follow the manager's compatibility checks, warnings, and refresh/restart instructions. Do not edit profile manifests, replace host files, or bypass version restrictions.

To disable, list bundles again to confirm the exact name, then use:

@yyyzl/dsh-image-feedback README · Install：```json
{"action":"set_bundle","target":"@yyyzl/dsh-image-feedback","enabled":false}
```

Use `enabled: true` to re-enable, or `remove_bundle` to uninstall. Disabling does not itself erase image assets, saved drafts, or browser recovery data.
